ssaggi e i requisiti dei modelli compatibili.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/macOS-iOS-27-Siri-App-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macOS-iOS-27-Siri-App-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17827,\"date\":\"2026-09-17T09:06:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-17T07:06:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"benchmark-geekbench-7-chip-apple-m6-prima-del-nuovo-mac-mini\",\"title\":\"Benchmark Geekbench 7: chip Apple M6 in evidenza prima del nuovo Mac mini\",\"excerpt\":\"Un primo risultato Geekbench 7 non verificato mostra le prestazioni del nuovo chip Apple M6: 4.071 in single-core e 22.783 in multi-core. Atteso il debutto sul nuovo Mac mini.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/Mac-mini-M6-chip-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Mac-mini-M6-chip\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17825,\"date\":\"2026-09-17T08:44:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-17T06:44:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"airpods-5-hands-on-migliore-cancellazione-rumore-prezzo-basso\",\"title\":\"AirPods 5 in prova: cancellazione del rumore migliore e prezzo più basso\",\"excerpt\":\"Hands-on con AirPods 5: ANC migliorata grazie a nuova architettura acustica, microfoni a basso rumore e prezzo d’ingresso con cancellazione attiva a 129 dollari.\",\"categoryName\":\"Offerte\",\"categorySlug\":\"offerte\",\"categoryId\":501,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/AirPods-5-Hands-On-Thumb-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"AirPods-5-Hands-On-Thumb\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\"